description "Jango Fett

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- RoF: 1.05x
- WESTAR-34 Blaster Pistols (3)
^2-- Non-disarmable
^2-- RoF: 1.05x
^2-- Velocity: 1.05x
^2-- Damage: 1.05x
^2-- Drain: 1.1x
- Wrist Flamethrower ^9(Thrower)
^1-- Reload: .01x

^3Abilities:
- Rocket ^3[CS1]
^2-- Det: Stagger
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Dart Launcher ^9(Poison Dart 4) ^3[Melee CS3]
^2-- Hit: Track
^2-- Damage: 2x
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]
- Jetpack ^3[Hold/2x Jump]
^2-- No Cooldown

^6Items:
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Beskar (3)
- Healing (1)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon
^2- Fuel Regen: 1/1.2s
^2- Knockback Taken: .8x
^1- Knockback Given: .9x
^1- Skill Recharge: .8x

Known in his heyday as one of the greatest bounty hunters in the galaxy. Boasts an array of lethal weapons and gadgets."